sample.gr and sample.co are a synthetic graph of 900 nodes in the format of
the road graphs of the 9th DIMACS Implementation Challenge (shortest paths,
2006), written by tools/bench/dimacs_sample.py, small enough for the tests;
the graphs of the challenge (NY, 264346 nodes, to USA, 23947347) are
downloaded by tools/bench/fetch_dimacs.sh from
http://users.diag.uniroma1.it/challenge9/download.shtml.
